%T A402312 4,4,4,4,2,2,8,8,8,8,2,2,2,1,8,8,8,8,8,3,3,3,12,12,12,12,12
%N A402312 Narrow class numbers associated with terms of A094847.
%C A402312 a(n) is the narrow class number of the real quadratic field K = Q(sqrt(A094847(n))). This means that a(n) = A094848(n) if the fundamental unit of K has norm -1 and 2*A094848(n) if the fundamental unit of K has norm 1.
%H A402312 D. H. Lehmer, E. Lehmer and D. Shanks, <a href="/A002189/a002189.pdf">Integer sequences having prescribed quadratic character</a>, Math. Comp., 24 (1970), 433-451 [Annotated scanned copy].
%H A402312 <a href="/index/Qua#quadfield">Index entries for sequences related to quadratic fields</a>.
%Y A402312 Cf. A094847. See A399983 for a list of related sequences.
